<title>AUSTRALIA: Sons of Gwalia plans asset sales, debt rejig.</title>
<headline>Sons of Gwalia plans asset sales, debt rejig.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner Sons of Gwalia Ltd said on Wednesday it plans to sell some of its assets and restructure its debt finance following the swag of acquisitions the company made last year.</p>
</text>
